ition that can occur if there are multiple tasks being awaited upon when quitting / exiting.  It may result in one task being awoken but not the one we need (which is to clean up and exit).  Changing to \"notify_all\" rather than \"notify_one\" fixes this race condition.  It become more obvious when compiling godot with zig 0.14.0 / LLVM 19.1.7.  It is present in existing versions of godot but occurs extremely rarely.  I suspect whatever changes were made in LLVM 19.1.7 simply make it occur more often.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-03-10T15:42:53Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T08:47:49Z","closed_at":"2025-03-13T02:48:01Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2903e543f20b47d0c618a0bb5e0a33a1e6a3d2c6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Lange-Studios:fix-godot-hanging-on-exit","ref":"fix-godot-hanging-on-exit","repo":{"id":700513708,"node_id":"R_kgDOKcD9rA","name":"godot","full_name":"Lange-Studios/godot","owner":{"login":"Lange-Studios","id":85369938,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjg1MzY5OTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85369938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lange-Studios","html_url":"https://github.com/Lange-Studios","followers_url":"https://a